 aychata rurashannömi gamcunaga ruraycanqui.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Gamcunaga juc junaj Tayta Diosta mañacunquipämi.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ichanga pay manami wiyashunquipänachu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Fiyupa mana allita rurashayquicunapitami","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"gamcunapitaga juc-läpa ticracurcongapaj.","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["Llulla profëtacunapaj parlashan"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["Chayno caj profëtacunata Tayta Diosga nin:",{"text":"«Israelcunaga manami alli cajta ruranchu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chaynöga caycan profëtacuna llullapaptinmi.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chay profëtacunaga pipis micuyta garaycoj cajta ‹allillami goyanquipaj› nin.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Micuyta mana garaj cajtanami ichanga ‹Mana allimi goyanquipaj› nin.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chaypitami gamcunataga manana musyachishayquinachu imata ruranäpaj cajtapis.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ima cananpaj cajcunatapis manami willapäshayquinachu.»","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chay profëtacunapäga intipis yagacongami.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Paycunapäga pachapis chacacäcongami.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chay profëtacunaga, musyacojcunaga","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"pasaypa pengaychömi ricaconga.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ruwacushanta Tayta Dios mana willaptin","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"paycunaga imata niytapis manami camäpacongapächu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nogatami ichanga Tayta Diospa Espiritun yanapäman","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"callpayoj canäpaj,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"alli cajllata ruranäpaj,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"balurchanäpaj.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chaynöpami Israelcunataga mana wiyacoj cashanta, juchayoj cashanta niycä.","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["Jerusalén ushacänanpaj cashan"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Rayta mandäshej Israelcuna,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Jacobpita mirajcunapa mandajnincunapis","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"canan nishäta wiyamay.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Gamcunaga manami alli cajta rurayta munanquichu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Lay nishancunatapis manami cumlinquichu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chaypitami Jerusalén siudächöga waran-waranpis caycan mana alli ruraycunalla wañuchinacuylla.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Autoridäcunapis runacuna pacayllapa pägashan cajta alli arriglan.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Cüracunapis guellayllapämi yachaycächin.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Profëtacunapis guellayllapämi willacuycan.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chayno ruraycarpis «Tayta Diosmi yanapaycäman» nir riguichin.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"«Tayta Diosga noganchïwanmi caycan.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ima mana allipis manami chayamäshunchu» nin.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Gamcunapa juchayquipitami","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Sión lömaga quëdanga yapyashano.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Jerusalén siudä quëdangapaj muntuy-muntuy rumicuna goturaycajlla.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Templu caycashan jircachöpis mana alli jachacunallana juntasha canga.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/qub_wbt/MIC/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/qub_wbt/MIC/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/qub_wbt/MIC/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}